Original SoloMapling
-------------------
Project: https://github.com/MadaraGameDev/SoloMapling
Authors: MadaraGameDev / Richy and the original SoloMapling contributors
Integration starting point: 47b61b5381118ebdc1064ddbd0b1c32f75778871

SoloMapling is built on Cosmic and contains Cosmic / HeavenMS / OdinMS-derived
engine code. Existing copyright notices, including those of Patrick Huy,
