Cosmic: https://github.com/P0nk/Cosmic

BeiDou
------
Project: https://github.com/BeiDouMS/BeiDou-Server
Authors: BeiDou and its upstream contributors
The official source is referenced by the upstream/BeiDou-Server submodule.
The initial integration baseline is release 1.12:
75a86268738ca8845e06ea9d59ec36d15b22c91b

The submodule source is not edited. Integration and build-time weaving are
maintained in this repository, and the generated application is a modified
derivative rather than an unmodified official BeiDou distribution.

